2 NOTE Husband Joshua BaI Give unto Sarah my Dearly beloved Wife. The use & Improvm:t of One third of all my Real Estate during Life with so much of my Dwelling house & Barn as shee shall have Occasion of. I also give her two Cows four Sheep and one swine
3 CONC . And a
