2 NOTE When Thomas Riggs was born on Dec 7, 1666, his father, Thomas, was 35 and his mother, Mary, was 27. He married Ann Wheeler on Nov 22, 1687, in Amesbury, Massachusetts. They had 11 children in 21 years. He died in August 1756 in Gloucester, Massa
