2 TITL Judith Greenleaf Somerby Coffin&#39;s Grave Inscription
1 _OID 940b88ff-5671-43a1-b930-e7f9b0ac6c6d
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p style="background: whitesmoke;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: verdana, sans-serif; background-color: white; background-: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"&gt;Judith Greenleaf
2 CONC , who married firstly HenrySomerby and secondly, 2 March 16523, Tristram Coffin, ws the mother of Elizabeth Somerby, wife of Nathaniel Clarke, and consequently ancestress of all the descendants of Nathaniel, and the inscription on her gravestone i
2 CONC n the westerly corner of the Old Town burying ground at Newbury ought to be of interest to her children's children through all generations. The stone, like many others of the period, was probably cut and carved in England or Wales, and lettered her
2 CONC e. It reads"&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 12.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 12.0pt; margin-: 0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: consolas
2 CONC ; mso-fareast-font-family: 'times new roman'; color: #333333;"&gt;It reads, "&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"&gt;To the memory of Mrs. Judith, late uirtuos wife of Deac. Tristram Coffin, Esqr, who ha
2 CONC ving lived to see 177 of her children and children s children to the 3d generation died Dec. 15, 1705, aged 80. Graue, sober, faithful, fruitfull vine was she, A rare example of true piety. Widow d awhile she wayted, wisht for rest, With her dear h
2 CONC usband in her Savior s brest."&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 12.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 12.0pt; margin-: 0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"&gt;Source: George Kuh
2 CONC n Clark, "The Descendants of Nathaniel Clarke and His Wife Elizabeth Somerby"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 12.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 12.0pt; margin-: 0in;"&gt;Accessed online 1213/13 at&amp;nbsp;https://a
2 CONC rchive.org/stream/descendantsofnat00inclar/descendantsofnat00inclar_djvu.txt&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
