1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'times new roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'times new roman'; mso-ansi-language: en-us; mso-fareast-language: en-gb; mso-bidi-language: ar-sa;"&gt;Enliste
2 CONC d 30 Jun 1804 in 2nd Battalion 78th Regiment of Foot he served with the regiment at Maida Italy on 4th Jul1806 and was wounded. He was captured on 21st April1807 at El Hamet Egypt and was imprisoned at Cairo till Sept 1807 and invalided out of th
2 CONC e army on 24st March1808 due to an arm wound received at El Hamet. He was Five feet &amp;amp; and half inches in height with Brown eyes Brown Hair and of a Fair Complexion. See Ken Nisbet's book for a history of the battalion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
2 CONC </line></content></metadataxml>
